        {
          "id": "p4-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "条例だと、十四日以内に開示を決めるの",
          "en": "Under the city ordinance, we have to decide on disclosure within fourteen days.",
          "note": "Each city sets its own deadline by ordinance. Fourteen or fifteen days is common (extensions are allowed); the national government gets thirty."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "しかも、誰でも、何件でもできる!!",
          "en": "And anyone can file, as many as they like!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "つまり、十四日ごとに、この箱が来るんですね",
          "en": "So a box like this arrives every fourteen days."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "自分の仕事に、もう何日も手をつけてません……",
          "en": "I haven't touched my own work in days..."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-5-1",
          "panel": 5,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "この箱、十円玉ひとつ入ってねえ",
          "en": "Not a single ten-yen coin in this box."
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-6-1",
          "panel": 6,
          "type": "caption",
          "ja": "――そこへ、請求者本人が。",
          "en": "And then, the requester himself."
        }
      ]
    },
