          "id": "p7-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "写しのコピー代、一枚十円だそうです",
          "en": "Copies cost ten yen a page, it says here.",
          "note": "Real practice: many Japanese cities charge about ten yen per black-and-white copy of a released document. The fee goes to the city, not the staff."
        },
        {
          "id": "p7-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "数百件なら、大儲けだァ!!",
